WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:33.430
Why is it...

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:38.900
he seems familiar, like I've missed him... but I've never seen him before...

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.220
Who was that?

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.350
The King has two sons.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:53.560
Crown Prince Somand is now 16, but his weak constitution keeps him from leaving the country.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.210
Then the second prince, His Highness Rumaty Ivan!

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.370
Rumaty!

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.720
Dammit, are you still...

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.720
Does it suit me?

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.480
Kajika!

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:19.380
"Pure Heart"

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:44.520
Are you hurt?

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.770
I--I'm fine.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:51.310
Here!

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.960
Oh! The cloth!

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.170
Leave it!

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:07.760
They're following us!

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.690
Obviously!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.730
As if hit men gave up that easily!

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:24.860
What do we do?

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.920
That was a quick getaway...

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.050
Did they cross to the opposite bank?

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:48.010
Uh-uh, not likely.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.090
Search the area!

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:51.850
It's imperative that you find His Highness!

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.290
"His Highness..."

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.850
Miss Kajika?

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:26.240
Huh?

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.000
Miss Kajika...?

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.890
Your Highness...?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.720
So I'm the target...

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.750
Can you think of anybody with a grudge against you?

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.720
Hm! When you're in the royal family...

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:01.510
there's always someone who's more or less immune to your charms.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.120
Royal family?

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:06.910
Mm-hmm. I'm a prince of the Kingdom of Raginei.

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.570
Somehow I've dragged you into this...

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:16.310
Don't worry... I'm only here because I wanted to come.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:20.220
Really...

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.500
I want to contact Quinza. Let me use your phone.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.820
I was planning to come right back, so...

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.630
I sort of left it in my room.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:33.980
Really.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.010
What's going on? You're not Pao and them from Kowloon.

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:45.180
Are you tourists?

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.150
Lee-Leng told me about this.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:50.090
These are Hong Kong street kids.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.610
You're a nice little woman...

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:58.970
You'd be an imbecile to go up against me.

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:02.740
You'd better get out of here right away, peasants!

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:04.210
What the hell?

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.930
Hey! Go ahead and do it!

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:13.970
Come!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.230
Rumaty...

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:35.520
What are you doing?

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.110
I said not to lay a hand on ordinary people.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.190
Ip Yun... s--sorry...

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:50.780
What are you doing out here?

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:54.320
This isn't the time or place for sight-seeing.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:01.210
Heh... you don't look much like tourists...

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.430
but hey, you don't look like gang members, either.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:08.370
I'm Ip Yun. This is my turf.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.350
If you can explain, I'll hear you out.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:16.810
It all went wrong...

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.310
if that kid hadn't interfered...

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.540
I'll definitely manage it next time...

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:38.020
You couldn't even handle a child...

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:39.990
you should be ashamed.

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.270
Leon...

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:51.030
Fail me this time, and you're finished.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.810
In that case it's back to the slums with you.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.370
She snuck out...

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.610
I see we don't learn from our mistakes...

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.050
I'm sorry...

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:08.120
Kajika invariably gets her way.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.230
Even if you'd tried to stop her... it wouldn't have worked.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.760
Where do you think she is?

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.580
Probably with Prince Rumaty... he's disappeared as well...

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:26.020
Just taking an evening stroll, perhaps...

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.010
If anything happens to those two...

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:31.330
there's no future for our family.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.380
Mr. Huang.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:36.210
I--I understand completely.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.420
We will absolutely find them!

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:42.840
Even in our country, His Highness has never been able to go out alone.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:47.070
If, by any chance, some accident should befall His Highness...

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:49.960
Hong Kong is our backyard.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.600
Legal, illegal...

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:55.140
every last organization...

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:57.240
is under our patronage.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.100
Leave this to the Huang family.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.190
I understand... my thanks for your efforts.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:14.490
--By the way... for a low-profile trip abroad...
--Hm?

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:18.440
you seem to have brought too strong an escort...

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:21.550
No. Not at all.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:25.480
An escort this size is standard in our country.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.650
Is that right...

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.660
The girl who left with him...

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.660
is Chairman Harry Burnsworth's only daughter.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.270
Chairman Burnsworth's...

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.590
In the Kingdom of Raginei...

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.550
Burnsworth is the single largest trade partner.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.380
You wouldn't want any cracks to appear...

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.020
in those friendly relations, would you?

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:54.040
I'd like you to lay all your cards on the table...

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.740
Whatever it is, we can deal with it.

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.980
Brother...

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.600
I understand.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.290
I sense an assassin's shadow hanging over the Prince.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:17.620
His Highness Rumaty... has been targeted by rebellious elements from one section of Raginei.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:23.230
Those elements aren't very powerful, though, right?

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:27.000
Of course. It's only the lunatic fringe.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:32.070
But to suppose that they could pursue His Highness all the way to Hong Kong...

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.580
someone is backing them, pulling the strings.

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.790
Someone who stands to gain by eliminating His Highness...

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:43.980
No. It's entirely unthinkable.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.390
You think so...

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.330
I'm sure.

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:56.430
That chamberlain, Quinza... regular methods won't work with him.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:58.660
Zao.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.620
Yes, sir.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.710
Can you look into Raginei's domestic affairs?

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.230
Especially the real state of the royal family?

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:08.260
The Kingdom of Raginei keeps a tight grip on information like that...

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:12.260
but if I could make use of Burnsworth's network, I could find a way.

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.480
The Prince of Raginei...

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:17.750
and Harry Burnsworth's only daughter...

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.010
encountering each other in a far-off, foreign land...

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.900
What an amazing coincidence.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.830
Ah! ... Hah?

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:30.630
Actually... they met because they were bound to.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.830
Naturally, Harry would've known...

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.700
sometime soon, Prince Rumaty...

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.170
would turn up, incognito, in Hong Kong.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.440
And of course...

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:44.720
I would bring Kajika with me here.

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:50.420
So that means Prince Rumaty... is the second man Mr. Burnsworth chose!

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.060
Probably so.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:25.390
Filthy... how can anyone live here...

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:30.410
I understand your situation.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.980
You can stay here for a night.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:33.740
Thanks.

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:36.200
It turns my stomach, though...

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.720
What does?

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:39.750
The guys that attacked you.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:42.590
What do they think they're playing on our island?

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.080
I'm thirsty.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.970
Ah, sorry. Is there anything to drink?

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.680
Sorry... hey, do me a favor...

00:12:57.680 --> 00:12:59.970
run out and buy something hot.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.890
Sure.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:16.790
How 'bout that!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:22.130
--It's all yours.
--I'll get you next time...

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:25.600
--Hey, it's your deal.
--No fair, I'm out.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.510
Aren't you going to play?

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:33.750
Play?

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.740
You get in, too.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:38.720
They all want to make friends with you.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:40.690
Friends?

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.700
You mean school friends?

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.370
School friends?

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:46.510
Hmm.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:49.550
Well, it's something like that.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.620
Don't be ridiculous.

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:54.060
School friends are appointed.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:55.970
Appointed?

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.730
I choose them.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.550
Whoever I choose...

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:02.390
--says it's an honor and gratefully accepts.
--You suck... --You're going down, Ip Yun.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.180
Those aren't real friends.
--Aw, bull. --Shut it!

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.210
But then, what does a real friend mean?

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:12.670
A friend isn't someone who's being forced.

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:16.050
You become close because you get along...

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:20.030
That's how it was at my school in Japan...

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:25.570
everyone playing, studying, and laughing together...

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.740
even getting angry sometimes...

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:32.190
and getting to know each other that way as we learned various things.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:35.870
There were never any ulterior motives.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.570
Is that really possible?

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.890
Mm-hmm... it's actually normal.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.940
Normal?

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.840
I want friends, too.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.100
You have me, don't you?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.840
I want to be friends with you.

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.970
This sucks. I'm not getting any good cards.

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:04.700
When you look at it, the two of them are a lot alike...

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.740
in their features... in their general atmosphere...

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:13.580
Yes?

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:14.810
It's me.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.120
Listen closely. Here's the deal...

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.440
Right... okay...

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:26.190
Huang? Huang like the multinational is looking for someone?

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:31.320
Sure... sure... huh?

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.180
That's it, I'm going to go look for them, too.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:05.910
Hold on.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.490
But...

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:11.560
You don't know the area at all, it wouldn't do any good if you went.

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:13.490
You'd just be a lost child.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:18.880
That cry...

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.680
Lucia!

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:28.710
That's...

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.700
That's His Highness Rumaty's holy cloth!

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.730
Your Highness...

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.740
You have me, don't you?

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:56.440
I want to be friends with you.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.000
Friends, huh?

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.890
It must be tough being a prince.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:10.400
Tough? I've never thought of it like that.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:13.420
This is what seems natural to me.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.290
I see...

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.340
Will you be King someday, Rumaty?

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.670
Me, King?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.450
Then you won't?

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:26.680
My older brother will inherit the throne.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.560
You have an older brother?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:33.470
Yeah...  unlike me, my brother is gentle...

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.120
Because of a royal custom...

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:39.560
we live apart these days, and I don't get to see him often...

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.050
but when I was little I always played with big brother.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.330
We would play hide-and-seek in the palace...

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:51.230
and if the Head Chamberlain caught us getting into trouble, my brother always protected me.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:55.190
Now I want to help him.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:58.630
My brother is sickly, so I can help him...

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.880
and make Raginei everything that God and the people could want.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.010
Your eyes are gentle...

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.520
You were always angry...

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.790
so this is the first time I've seen you look kind and gentle.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.710
Th--that's only because you keep making me angry.

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:26.800
You seem familiar somehow...

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:30.970
I felt the same way when I first met you.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.700
Excuse me for interrupting.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.030
The night air isn't healthy.

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:44.520
Come on inside.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:54.260
They were being chased, so I said I'd hide them for the night.

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:58.180
It must be true. That earring...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.170
it's the mark of a member of Raginei's royal family.

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:04.040
The Sun Earring...

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.940
Are you ready for this?

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:13.370
That child is the Prince of Raginei.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:15.520
A prince?

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.990
You're serious.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.790
The Huang are probably on the move.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:28.340
What a stray you picked up!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.320
Hey, Ton Ie, wait!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.840
I'll be right back! Don't let anyone in!

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.370
Got it.

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:42.840
Still no drinks?

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:47.120
I don't really get it, Ton Ie.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.570
Explain it to me fully...

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.160
First, I have to report this to the boss.

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:54.220
I'll talk along the way. So listen up, and come with me!

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.150
Don't lose sight of the bird!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:31.510
It looks like they were chased by someone...

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:40.690
Yes?

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.330
Toranosuke, we know where they are.

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:49.030
Ah, you're late.

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:54.420
R--RUN!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.230
Rumaty!

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:28.500
You... you're Raginei Royal Guard Officers!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:30.990
They're on your side?

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:34.160
Yeah... they're my brother's personal bodyguards...

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:37.740
I see! My brother sent you for my sake to--

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.220
What is this?

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:52.140
Say nothing to my younger brother...

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:55.620
...to Rumaty... and kill him.

00:22:12.170 --> 00:22:14.230
Your Highness Rumaty...

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:16.280
for the sake of the country...

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:18.020
please forgive me.

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:26.510
Kajika!

00:22:49.980 --> 00:22:53.100
No! Rumaty... run!

00:22:55.870 --> 00:22:58.570
Rumaty!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
